See on range eksimus.

103
00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.050
Okei.

104
00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:07.250
So

105
00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:09.590
you not?

106
00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.240
Discount.

107
00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.940
Nothing, kui ei tule tagasi,
siis ei tule.

108
00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:17.269
Kui ta otsustab uuesti tulla,
siis lihtsalt loodame,

109
00:17:17.369 --> 00:17:21.269
et ta läheb paremini. Et kõik on
nii, nagu ta soovib.

110
00:17:21.369 --> 00:17:26.920
I Kivi on fifti persent,
iscount on boti treetment,

111
00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:31.390
seega Jos teel treet ment like de
and ou kanget scon.

112
00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:36.835
Ma olen ise väga rahul sellise
lahenduse.

113
00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:52.880
Mina administraatorina pean.

114
00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:56.760
Mõistma, et on
ka selliseid inimesi suhtuma

115
00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:00.300
